    "Name": "Cecerops",
    "Details": "The Cecerops ProtoMech was designed and built by Clan Blood Spirit using materials acquired from Clan Snow Raven. Though not as heavily armored as some other ProtoMechs, the design's high speed prevents most opponents from getting a target lock. Exchanging the ER Micro Laser for a Micro Pulse Laser, this variant drops the speed slightly and reduces armor protection.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Nimble</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.96</color></b>",
